WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.163
- I have to ask.

00:00:01.163 --> 00:00:04.110
I heard that your first ever
concert was pretty amazing.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.040
You wanna tell everybody who that was?

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.850
- First ever, oh, what
a come around moment

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:09.930
with the Jackson 5.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.763
- [Kelly] That's amazing.

00:00:10.763 --> 00:00:11.940
- Yes.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:12.960
- Somebody told me that,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.060
'cause I always ask, 'cause
obviously I'm a musician,

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.500
so I always ask like what people go see

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.330
and that's your first concert?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.640
- Yes, and my sister and
I were in North Carolina.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.960
My poor uncle.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.850
He had gotten us tickets.
- Yeah.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.320
- And they got great
tickets 'cause we were

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.570
in like the first or second row.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:28.403
- What?

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.390
- We had our little,
you know, bolero jacket,

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:33.840
hot pants and Samson and Delilah sandals.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.470
And I swear, they looked
right at me and sang the song

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.400
and it was just great.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.520
And then many, many, many
years later when I decided

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.820
to become an actress, to play
Miss Katherine, their mom.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.653
- Oh my God.

00:00:45.653 --> 00:00:48.270
- And she was just, she's
an absolute delight.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:49.380
- What a full circle.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.213
- Delight.

00:00:50.213 --> 00:00:53.760
And I remember being at the
Image Awards and Miss Katherine

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.650
walked by and it was
like, and we would sit,

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.870
have lunch and look at
the clouds and talk.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:58.703
Such a mother.

00:00:58.703 --> 00:01:00.600
- Yeah.
- Such you know, inspiration.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.690
And so she stopped and Michael
and he turned around like mom

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:08.180
and he came back and he was
like, oh you were wonderful.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:12.390
And I was that 12 year old all over again.

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:13.223
- [Kelly] Isn't that crazy?

00:01:13.223 --> 00:01:14.056
When stuff like that happens?
- It's rolling me back.

00:01:14.056 --> 00:01:17.070
I was just like, oh my God,
his hand is in my hand.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.420
- Oh, that's so cool.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:21.120
And what a, I just can't say it enough.

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.083
It's a very rad first concert.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.583
I was like, I don't know
if anybody can beat that.

